   "textLength": 874,
   "text": "At some point the LLM scrapers discovered our site, and started sending us maybe 10\nrequests per second. I blocked them which is working for now, but it made me\nthink about what the site’s capacity is. I’m used to writing Go backends where\nthe performance situation is pretty straightforward (usually everything is just\nfast enough), and a Django site is very different.\nSome light load testing (with",
